# Backend-specific docker ignore — used by BuildKit when building with
# `-f backend-go/Dockerfile`. Overrides the root `.dockerignore` (which
# excludes `backend-go` for frontend builds).
#
# This file is intentionally minimal: we want to INCLUDE backend-go/ in
# the build context (the root .dockerignore would exclude it).

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist
.claude
docs
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
